{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are an investigator, hired by families of missing individuals from several unsolved disappearance cases. Each case is hauntingly similar, all their final phone calls were traced back to that specific payphone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Payphone is a bite-sized, first person horror experience inspired by low-poly retro aesthetic and a pinch of analog horror. Explore a forgotten stretch of road, swallowed by utter darkness and loneliness while slowly piecing together what might have happened, or rather, what caused the disappearance.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745290?t=1750839023","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/b4f5ce6cba192689faa60615cad1f3e97090cc8d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750839023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/9aa82ed574675f51763955f88769b5ad503c95e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750839023","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745290/9aa82ed574675f51763955f88769b5ad503c95e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750839023","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game features blood stains, scenes implying violence, and evidence of deceased characters. Some imagery may be unsettling or intense for sensitive players. \r\n\r\nViewer discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are an investigator, hired by families of missing individuals from several unsolved disappearance cases. Each case is hauntingly similar, all their final phone calls were traced back to that specific payphone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Payphone is a bite-sized, first person horror experience i